/*
 * proximight.rc — Win32 resources for the application executable.
 *
 * The ICON resource is what Explorer, shortcuts and the taskbar's pinned entry
 * use for proximight.exe itself. It is a different mechanism from the window
 * icon: that one is rasterized at run time from the same geometry by
 * gui_icon_chain_rgba() and applied with glfwSetWindowIcon(). Both draw the
 * interlocked chain-link brand mark, so they stay visually consistent.
 *
 * Icon id 1: the shell picks the ICON resource with the lowest id for the file's
 * own icon, so keep this first.
 *
 * The path is relative to THIS file's directory (rc.exe resolves it that way),
 * and forward slashes are used so it needs no escaping.
 */

1 ICON "../../assets/icons/proximight.ico"
